        {
          "text": "It’s eight thirty already. How late are they open?”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 480
        },
        {
          "text": "“Until ten. I just need to exchange these and then get a couple more presents.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 530
        },
        {
          "text": "“More presents?”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 608
        },
        {
          "text": "“Yeah. Are you all done with your shopping?”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 623
        },
        {
          "text": "“No, Friday I’m sneaking out while Carlos is with the kids",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 666
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "原句2",
      "no": 2,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "How was Brisa’s play?”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 844
        },
        {
          "text": "“It was bad.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 865
        },
        {
          "text": "“What do you mean bad?”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 877
        },
        {
          "text": "“I’ll tell you later. Look, let me call you back, I need to call Mom before dinner. Oh, never mind, she has her Christma",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 899
        },
        {
          "text": "“She didn’t go.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1035
        },
        {
          "text": "“How come? She wouldn’t shut up about it all week. She was driving me nuts.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1049
        },
        {
          "text": "“She stayed with the kids.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1123
        },
        {
          "text": "“With what kids?”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1149
        },
        {
          "text": "“Well, with mine",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1165
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "原句3",
      "no": 3,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Jesus, Alba, couldn’t you have gone another time?”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1257
        },
        {
          "text": "“When?”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1306
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tomorrow, maybe?”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1312
        },
        {
          "text": "“No way, I can’t tomorrow.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1329
        },
        {
          "text": "“Why?”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1354
        },
        {
          "text": "“In the morning I’ve got the baby’s check-up, and in the afternoon we’re doing my birthday thing.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1359
        },
        {
          "text": "“Couldn’t you have just run out when Juan got off work?”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1453
        },
        {
          "text": "“Impossible.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1507
        },
        {
          "text": "“Friday, then.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1519
        },
        {
          "text": "“On Christmas Eve? Hell no",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1533
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "原句4",
      "no": 4,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "You could have asked me to exchange them when I go for my stuff on Friday.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1560
        },
        {
          "text": "“Were you planning to go to Finestrelles?”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1635
        },
        {
          "text": "“No, but surely they have them at Corte Inglés?”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1676
        },
        {
          "text": "“It doesn’t matter, it’s an exchange. It has to be MediaMarkt",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1723
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "原句5",
      "no": 5,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "You know she cares! She got her nails done yesterday!”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2060
        },
        {
          "text": "“Yeah, but I can’t take the bus by myself.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2114
        },
        {
          "text": "“Why not?”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2155
        },
        {
          "text": "“Because it’s always packed this time of year and I get overwhelmed with the baby.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2164
        },
        {
          "text": "“But why did you take the baby?”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2245
        },
        {
          "text": "“In case he got hungry.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2276
        },
        {
          "text": "“Oh please, he’s practically a teenager! He’s almost a year old, Alba! He can go a few hours without your boob!”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2299
        },
        {
          "text": "“No, no, when he wants to nurse, he throws a fit.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2408
        },
        {
          "text": "“Well, you give him a cookie and that’s that",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2457
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "原句6",
      "no": 6,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "You can’t celebrate two things at once. It’s bad luck. And you know it.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 3753
        },
        {
          "text": "“Christ, Alba, I’ve got to go. We’ll talk later",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 3823
